page('security.html','Digital access. Documented safeguards.','Bank-stated controls, not an independent security audit. Empty fields are unverified. No overall security score is invented.',table(['Bank','Digital / security evidence','FDIC institution evidence','Opening & access rules','Official sources'],security)+'<h2>Coverage is not fraud insurance</h2><p>FDIC deposit insurance addresses insured bank failure, not a promise to reimburse every scam or unauthorized transaction. Safeguards and reimbursement policies are distinct; read applicable bank terms. Never share one-time codes; protect the linked email and phone as well as the bank login. '+links('fdic','ally-security')+'</p>')
